  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6501.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to adopt rules for the ignition interlock program, including but not limited to the approval of ignition interlock devices and for the licensing of approved interlock service providers.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 6500) #13448, eff 9-20-22",
